"P3660958464" "Protect the time capsule"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3629060192" "The temptation to look inside the time capsule is almost unbearable. But you cannot bring yourself to break the seal."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3519757326" "You saved the time capsule!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1917096569" "You failed to prevent the villains from destroying the time capsule."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3980702590" "I'm very proud to bestow upon you the right to wear a cape. I know Hero 1 himself would be glad to see you wearing it. You represent everything he died fighting for. Maybe we don't say it enough, {HeroName}, but this city is lucky to have you."
// RandomFameString :
"P2946619448" "Did you see {HeroName}'s new cape? Stylish!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P834799801" "I'll dispatch a team of heroes to see if they can recover any fragment of the Omega Team time capsule. Don't feel bad, {HeroName}. The Lost ambushed you. I can't give you a cape this time, but if you want to try again, I'll be here."

