// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1224340985" "Ah, {HeroName}! So glad you could make it! My new method of enhancing your powers involves a lot of work, a few ingredients, and just a bit of cold fusion. It's really quite fascinating. If you will help me by providing the ingredients, I can do the rest. <br><br>First I'll need a piece of cybernetic steel. I'd be surprised if you couldn't find such a thing on the Freakshow. I'll also need a particular part from a Rikti plasma weapon. Lastly, there's a strange gelatinous goo that often coats the Devouring Earth creatures. It's heavily infused with adrenaline and enzymes, and it's proved critical to this project. I'm sure you can find all three groups in Crey's Folly."

